pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 50]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-active
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 46, 320, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF"
  - elementId: nav-text1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [0, 0, 320, 50]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "#FFFFFFAA"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>研究背景与问题</p>
  - elementId: nav-text2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 0, 320, 50]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "#FFFFFFAA"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>难点与挑战</p>
  - elementId: nav-text3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 0, 320, 50]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: nav-text4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 50]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "#FFFFFFAA"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>技术细节与评估</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 70, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>提出的解决方案：RV-MalTrace</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 115, 80, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: arch-flow-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 140, 1160, 100]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightbg"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#E2E5EA"
  - elementId: arch-flow-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 145, 1120, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$primary;"><strong>CVA6 RTL</strong></span>  →  <span style="color:$primary;"><strong>Trace Tap</strong></span>  →  <span style="color:$primary;"><strong>Trace Packet</strong></span>  →  <span style="color:$primary;"><strong>Sink</strong></span>  →  <span style="color:$accent;"><strong>Behavior Graph</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:14px; color:$secondary;">commit/CSR/trap/wb signals  →  sideband tap  →  JSONL event  →  BRAM/UART  →  semantic reconstruction</span></p>
  - elementId: sol1-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 265, 5, 75]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: sol1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 265, 500, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>核心设计：RTL 级 Sideband Trace Tap</strong></p>
  - elementId: sol1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 295, 500, 85]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>在 CVA6 中植入轻量级 trace tap，捕获 committed behavior 事件（syscall、branch、trap、CSR、privilege change），不改变 core 状态。</p>
  - elementId: sol2-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 265, 5, 75]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: sol2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 265, 520, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>事件驱动：仅记录 Committed 事件</strong></p>
  - elementId: sol2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 295, 520, 70]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>不记录 speculative、被 flush/kill 的指令、错误路径上的控制流。只记录真正影响 architectural state 的事件。</p>
  - elementId: sol3-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 385, 5, 75]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: sol3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 385, 500, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>语义重建流水线</strong></p>
  - elementId: sol3-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 415, 500, 55]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>hardware trace → Python parser → code map (ELF+symbol) → runtime map → behavior graph。每一步标注来源。</p>
  - elementId: sol4-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 385, 5, 75]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: sol4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 385, 520, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>明确的证据来源标记</strong></p>
  - elementId: sol4-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 415, 520, 55]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>每个重建字段标注来源：hardware_derived、elf_mapped、runtime_inferred、reference_oracle。避免证据混淆。</p>
  - elementId: bottom-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 500, 1160, 120]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: bottom-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 505, 1120, 110]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>分阶段验证策略：</strong></p>
        <p>Vivado simulation MVP  →  Bare-metal board bring-up  →  Linux workload  →  Controlled malware-like surrogate</p>
        <p>每一阶段都有对应的 artifact checker 和 golden comparison，不跨阶段声称。</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 690, 60, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>10</p>
